---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { profile } from '../data/profile';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const resumeHref = `${base}${profile.resumePdfPath.replace(/^\//, '')}`;
const portfolioHref = `${base}${profile.portfolioPdfPath.replace(/^\//, '')}`;
---

<BaseLayout title="Contact | Kang Banseok Portfolio" description="강반석 포트폴리오 연락처 페이지입니다.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Contact</span>
      <h1>성과 흐름을 함께 개선할 수 있는 팀을 찾고 있습니다</h1>
      <p>인하우스 퍼포먼스 마케팅, 그로스 마케팅, CRM/Marketing Ops, Growth PM Assistant 포지션을 중심으로 지원합니다.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container contact-grid">
      <article class="info-panel">
        <h2>Links</h2>
        <p><strong>Email</strong><br /><a class="text-link" href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>{profile.email}</a></p>
        <p><strong>GitHub</strong><br /><a class="text-link" href={profile.githubUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">{profile.githubUrl}</a></p>
        <p><strong>Notion</strong><br /><a class="text-link" href={profile.notionUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">{profile.notionUrl}</a></p>
      </article>
      <article class="info-panel">
        <h2>PDF Files</h2>
        <p>PDF 이력서와 PDF 포트폴리오를 `public/files/` 폴더에 넣은 뒤 아래 링크를 활성화하세요.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn-primary" href={resumeHref}>Resume PDF</a>
          <a class="btn-secondary" href={portfolioHref}>Portfolio PDF</a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
